# Holidays in Russian: с Но́вым го́дом!
subtitle: "Wish people well in Russian: с днём рожде́ния, с Но́вым го́дом and с Восьмы́м ма́рта, поздравля́ю тебя́, and жела́ю сча́стья и здоро́вья."
tags: ["russian","russian holidays","happy birthday in russian","new year","russian phrases"]
teaches: ["vocabulary/holidays","phrases/wishes"]
thumb: "band \"Happy New Year, word for word\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A ninth Russian story: New Year at Masha's","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/90-russian-review-9.cast"}

## Holidays in Russian: с Но́вым го́дом!
