    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, с днём рожде́ния!","gloss":"Masha, happy birthday!"},{"by":"b","text":"Спаси́бо, Том! Ра́да тебя́ ви́деть.","gloss":"Thanks, Tom! Glad to see you."},{"by":"a","text":"Э́то тебе́. Жела́ю сча́стья и здоро́вья!","gloss":"This is for you. I wish you happiness and health!"},{"by":"b","text":"Спаси́бо! А что ты де́лаешь на Но́вый год?","gloss":"Thank you! And what are you doing for New Year?"},{"by":"a","text":"Ещё не зна́ю. А ты?","gloss":"I don't know yet. And you?"},{"by":"b","text":"Я бу́ду до́ма, с ма́мой и па́пой. Бу́дет ёлка!","gloss":"I'll be at home, with Mum and Dad. There'll be a tree!"},{"by":"a","text":"А ёлка уже́ гото́ва?","gloss":"Is the tree ready already?"},{"by":"b","text":"Ещё нет. Приходи́, бу́дет ве́село!","gloss":"Not yet. Come over, it'll be fun!"}] show_gloss false practice true size 1.75 hidden true
    text na_ng "на Но́вый год" say "на Но́вый год" x 500 y 600 font_size 66 hidden true
    text yolka_g "ёлка гото́ва" say "ёлка гото́ва" colors {"а$":"#b5482e"} x 500 y 440 font_size 66 hidden true
    icon q_tree size 200 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["evergreen tree"] icon_look picture of "christmas tree" hidden true
    icon q_gift size 200 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["gift"] icon_look picture of "wrapped gift" hidden true
    icon q_clock size 170 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["mantelpiece clock","alarm clock"] icon_look picture of "twelve o’clock" hidden true
    icon q_tree2 size 200 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["evergreen tree"] icon_look picture of "christmas tree" hidden true
    icon q_cake size 200 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["cake","shortcake"] icon_look picture of "birthday cake" hidden true
    text q_full "Поздравля́ю тебя́ с Но́вым го́дом!" say "Поздравля́ю тебя́ с Но́вым го́дом!" say_voice b colors {"ым$":"#2f6b8f","ом$":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 650 font_size 48 hidden true
    text b1 "С днём рожде́ния!" say "С днём рожде́ния!" colors {"ём$":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 600 font_size 50 hidden true
    text b2 "Поздравля́ю тебя́ с Но́вым го́дом!" say "Поздравля́ю тебя́ с Но́вым го́дом!" colors {"ым$":"#2f6b8f","ом$":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 480 font_size 50 hidden true
    text b3 "Жела́ю сча́стья и здоро́вья!" say "Жела́ю сча́стья и здоро́вья!" colors {"ья$":"#1a8a8a"} x 500 y 360 font_size 50 hidden true

A: You can already name a holiday: восьмо́е ма́рта, a пра́здник since lesson 54.
    draw o_tulip o_date

    erase o_tulip o_date

A: Today: what you say to someone on the day itself.
    draw cake

A: It's Masha's birthday, so I say: (@draw s_dr@) с днём рожде́ния!

A: That's день (@draw dr_base@) рожде́ния from lesson 45 with с in front, and after (@highlight s_dr color #5b8c5a part ^С effect underline@) с comes the with-ending.

B: День drops its е and takes ём: день, днём. Рожде́ния stays as it is.
    highlight s_dr color #2f6b8f part ём effect underline

    erase cake s_dr dr_base

A: The biggest holiday of the Russian year is New Year: Но́вый год.
    draw tree ng

B: Но́вый год — са́мый большо́й пра́здник.
    draw ng_big

    erase ng_big

A: For it, (@draw yolka@) Russians put up a ёлка, a fir tree, and the (@draw tree_gift@) presents go under it.

A: Orthodox Christmas comes later, on the seventh of January.
    draw jan7

    erase jan7

B: So at midnight on the thirty-first: с Но́вым го́дом!
    draw s_ng

A: (@draw drug@) Both words take the with-ending, as in с (@highlight s_ng color #2f6b8f part ым$ effect underline@) но́вым дру́гом: (@highlight s_ng color #2f6b8f part ом$ effect underline@) Но́вым, го́дом.

    erase tree tree_gift ng yolka s_ng drug

A: To make a whole sentence, start with поздравля́ю: I congratulate you.
    draw pozd

B: Поздравля́ю тебя́ с днём рожде́ния!
    draw pozd_dr

A: Поздравля́ю тебя́, then с and the day, always in the with-ending.
    highlight pozd_dr color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase pozd pozd_dr

A: And on Women's Day: с Восьмы́м ма́рта! The number takes ым, like Но́вым.
    draw tulip2 s_8

    erase tulip2 s_8

A: Now you. С Но́вым го́дом: which day is it for?
    draw c_line c_tulip c_cake c_tree

    ask "Tap the day you say it on." choose ["c_tulip","c_cake","c_tree"] answer c_tree pool false
        right: The ёлка: с Но́вым го́дом!
        wrong: Но́вый год: the one with the ёлка.

    erase c_line c_tulip c_cake c_tree

A: Then add a wish. Жела́ю is I wish.
    draw gift zh

B: Жела́ю сча́стья!
    draw zh_s

A: What you wish takes the of-ending, as after нет: (@draw zh_s_base@) сча́стье, happiness, becomes сча́стья. And its (@highlight zh_s color #5b8c5a part ^сч effect underline@) сч sounds like щ.

B: И здоро́вья! Здоро́вье, health, becomes здоро́вья.
    draw zh_z

    erase gift zh zh_s zh_s_base zh_z

A: Listen: Masha phones her mum.
    draw ear

    ask "Which holiday is it?" voice b options ["New Year","a birthday","the eighth of March"] correct 3 reveal.text "с Восьмы́м ма́рта" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        listen: Ма́ма, с Восьмы́м ма́рта! Жела́ю здоро́вья!
        right: The eighth of March: с Восьмы́м ма́рта.
        wrong: Listen for the day after с: Восьмы́м ма́рта.

    erase ear

A: Now Masha's birthday party: I come with (@draw p_gift@) a present. Listen; then tap Practise after the dialogue to say it yourself.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk p_gift

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: На Но́вый год is for New Year.
    draw na_ng

A: And ёлка is a she, so гото́ва ends in а: ёлка гото́ва.
    draw yolka_g

    erase na_ng yolka_g

    draw q_tree

    quiz "Поздравля́ю с ___ го́дом! Which form?" reveal.text "с Но́вым го́дом" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Но́вым: after с, new takes the with-ending, like го́дом.
        wrong: After с comes the with-ending, as in с но́вым дру́гом.
        * Но́вый
        + Но́вым
        * Но́вого

    erase q_tree

    draw q_gift

    quiz "You wish someone happiness: Жела́ю ___!" reveal.text "Жела́ю сча́стья!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Сча́стья: what you wish takes the of-ending.
        wrong: After жела́ю, the wish takes the of-ending, as after нет.
        * сча́стье
        * сча́стьем
        + сча́стья

    erase q_gift

    draw q_clock q_tree2

    quiz "New Year's Eve: the clock strikes midnight. What do you say?" reveal.text "С Но́вым го́дом!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        + С Но́вым го́дом!
        * С днём рожде́ния!
        * Пока́!

    erase q_clock q_tree2

    draw q_gift

    ask say_it "Жела́ю сча́стья и здоро́вья!" gloss "I wish you happiness and health!" voice b show cue reveal.text "Жела́ю сча́стья и здоро́вья!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase q_gift

    draw q_tree

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I congratulate you on the New Year." answer ["поздравляю тебя с новым годом","поздравляю с новым годом","поздравляю вас с новым годом"] voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Поздравля́ю тебя́ с Но́вым го́дом: с and the with-ending on both words.
        wrong: Поздравля́ю тебя́, then с, then Но́вый год with the with-ending: ым and ом.

B: Поздравля́ю тебя́ с Но́вым го́дом!
    draw q_full

    erase q_tree q_full

    group sum members ["b1","b2","b3"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So: с and the with-ending for the day, поздравля́ю in front for a whole sentence, жела́ю and the of-ending for the wish.
    highlight sum color #5b8c5a effect underline

A: And one greeting fits any holiday at all: с пра́здником.
    text b4 "С пра́здником!" say "С пра́здником!" colors {"ом$":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 220 font_size 60

    erase sum b4

B: С пра́здником! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text end_say "С пра́здником! Пока́!" say "С пра́здником! Пока́!" say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 56

    erase end_masha end_say

A: Next time: a story. New Year at Masha's.
    box next90 "Next: lesson 90 · Но́вый год у Ма́ши" x 500 y 430 width 700 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

